    "updated_at": "2026-04-16T19:31:46Z",
    "body": "> Right now all of the `shadowroot*` properties map to `attachShadow({})` properties. Do we want to add `adoptedStyleSheets` to [`ShadowRootInit`](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dictdef-shadowrootinit)?\r\n\r\nNote that the current properties of `ShadowRootInit` become read only on the `ShadowRoot`, unlike `adoptedStylesheets` whch is a mutable array-like thing.\r\n\r\nSo I think it might be nice to include it in the init dictionary but I could also see why it's not necessary.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/4262854668/reactions",
